---
/**
 * Terms of use for board.akibh.dev. What this site actually is: a free,
 * unofficial index of public government notices — no accounts, payments or
 * user content — so the terms centre on accuracy, "not official", links,
 * takedown/corrections and reuse of the data feed (/notices.json, /feed.xml).
 */
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = '2026-10-23';
---

<LegalPage title="Terms of use" description="Ground rules for board.akibh.dev: unofficial listing, check the official notice, no warranty, corrections and takedowns." updated={updated}>
  <p class="summary">
    <strong>Short version:</strong> this is an unofficial, free listing that links to official notices. It can be late
    or wrong, so always confirm deadlines, eligibility and how to apply on the official site. I'll fix or remove
    anything on request.
  </p>

  <h2>About these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These terms cover <a href={site.url}>board.akibh.dev</a>, run by me, {site.author.name}. By using the site you
    agree to them. How data is handled is in the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What this site is — and isn't</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>It is an <strong>independent, unofficial</strong> aggregator of public recruitment notices from Bangladeshi government bodies and recruitment portals.</li>
    <li>It is <strong>not affiliated with, endorsed by or acting for</strong> any government body, Teletalk, Bangladesh Bank or any other source named on it.</li>
    <li>It does <strong>not accept applications, documents or payments</strong>. Anyone asking you for money to "secure" a job through this site is not me — report it to me and to the official body.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Accuracy and no warranty</h2>
  <p>
    Notices are collected automatically at build time and may be delayed, incomplete, mis-parsed or out of date.
    Deadlines, posts and other details shown here are for convenience only. <strong>The official notice is always
    the authoritative version</strong> — open it and verify before you act. The site is provided "as is", without
    warranties, and may change, pause or go offline at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    As far as the law allows, I'm not liable for any loss or damage (including a missed deadline or application) from
    using this site, its data, or the sites it links to. Nothing here limits rights the law doesn't allow to be limited.
  </p>

  <h2>Content and reuse</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The notices themselves belong to their publishers. The site shows only short facts (title, organization, dates, a link) and always links to the original. It doesn't copy or host notice documents.</li>
    <li>The site's design and code are © {site.author.name}.</li>
    <li>Personal, non-commercial use of the table, <a href="/notices.json">/notices.json</a> and <a href="/feed.xml">/feed.xml</a> is welcome. Please don't hammer them with automated requests, and credit board.akibh.dev if you republish the list.</li>
    <li>Names and logos belong to their owners and are used only to identify them.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Don't attack, overload or scrape the site abusively, and don't use it to mislead people (for example by presenting it as an official portal).</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>Each "Open" link leads to a site I don't control. I'm not responsible for its content, availability or policies.</p>

  <h2>Corrections, takedowns and contact</h2>
  <p>
    Spotted a wrong date, a broken link or a notice that shouldn't be listed? Email{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.author.email}`}>{site.author.email}</a> with the page or row and I'll fix or remove it
    promptly. I may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version, always at{' '}
    <a href="/terms/">board.akibh.dev/terms/</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
